  unitName: Nyan Slash Bayley
  unitId: 830004
  unitNumber: 8007
  description: A practitioner of the lost "Nyan-jutsu" style of martial arts. She
    cheated death with one of her nine lives, escaping the gods' wrath unscathed
    after the Battle Maidens challenged them. Realizing her fists were still developing,
    she left for the mountains where she trained day and night, striving to reach
    her full potential.
  summonDesc: Nya! Fear not!<br>Leave everything to my<br>Nyan-jutsu fists!
  fusionDesc: Nya! What a nice treat. <br>I can work harder <br>on a full stomach!
  evoDesc: The Nyan-jutsu style has <br>a heritage of over 2000 years! <br>Nothing
    beats it, nya!
